        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sirbiida nyar",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, “Una shaaha sirbiida aba heeda siida sina dahuundiga, ng'ata giloadi gwearsu ng'ay ea ashoohoodisu ng'ay, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak giideayeewi ea ahita moangoachiyda orjeeda Hinomu mida murdeeda gidaghuuta sisina sheang'weeda, ak abeeda gayrukuta gichea darukuneeyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajeeshiina, ‘Ea sugoodiga Yuda ea fuga abiita Yerusalemu, oaleaydiit ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA. Ayiinya gidarugu NG'UTAMIIDA bea lugweega, was ASEETA fuga Israeli, Ang'ula, gaydajagu munyinda badaydeaba ng'eanyiini nea gilinyoo ghwayiiy ng'asheanji gayghwanyeal iidigaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba fiisu nijaktaneani, nea ning'uda ririnnyeanda hiji aba ghwardeayda hideeda ng'andit aseecheeka suuk was gea mwanala saawa ghana ghweaniga nyaawa ghana eara sugoodiga Yuda; nea ea niinyiit hiji aba foojeanda fuga manda giidiinyeanda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea ea nideas heetiyeada bea Baali jea gagwariideayiisa diibiga nyaawa ghoah haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi sigwariida eataw Baali; ng'asheanda ghayi miidarukuta, nea eara jeeda gurooroodeanyu ea mii gawa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "asi, ng'ula, gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, gayghwahidu eemoojiga jea ea maygudu eeguura hiji Dofeti; ghana moangoachiyda orjeeda Hinomu, hean gajeeguura moangoachiyda sinuukiisa buuneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydadatas gida gasa gwasin fuga Yuda ea gea Yerusalemu, ak gaydanung' goosha fuga nyaawa aba ng'uta aba madeeda weajoodiga nyaawa, ea geatinga fuga gasa eaweega nyaawa. Nea muscheeka nyaawa gaydanung' ghoah daghwarda dariidaka humng'eeda ea diyeanga jarooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gaydanung' ghoah mujiineani gichea ghahamng'eanyi buuneeda, gayghoah gichea eemachiida; gilinyoo gwasik murdeadaanyi gayghahamng'eanyi nea ghamwachta aba nyariidaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydanung' ghwaak banyeega orjooga nyaawa ea gea haweega nyaawa, nea gaygaba siisi ak banyeega giischeewoocheandaanyi damanda sighasa nea gwanda jeeda hang'weaniidooda, damanda nineaweesa saawa weajoodiga gasa eaweega nyaawa gwasawan.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak abeeda gaynyarja sirbiida aba madeeda fuga iideayeewi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gajeeshiina saawa, ‘Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA bea lugweega: Gaydanyarjeawda fiisu ea mujiineani gawuurji gida nyarjeawiida siida dahuuda sheang'weeda, nea ea maygudu eamu eesin gicha. Nea buuneeda gajeebung'sa Dofeti aba gideaba mudu gwanda hich nuut jea eebung'sa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, Nih gichea dasima hiji gil, ea fuga abiita hiji, ak ghaanung' gawuurji mujiineani sea mujiineeda Dofeti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gealga Yerusalemu ea gealga sugoodiga Yuda ea gealga sean sigwardeaysa hideeda ng'andit iheenga nyaawa ak geataw malaykajeega humng'eeda, ea haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi was gea sileeha ea siitaw aseecheeka suuk, gajeang'uda ririnnyeanda gawuurji Dofeti.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iinea nibiikta Yeremiya Dofeti, heeda ghayi ajeakta NG'UTAMIIDA ghwaramoaran, hean gawa ak ghamiinaada aba doodooda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gwayeesha buuneeda sean: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA bea lugweega, was ASEETA fuga Israeli, “Ng'ula gaydaahaak mujiinajeesu ea gharang'weakaaschi munyinda ghayi eargu, aba gideaba niihang'waay iheenga nyaawa, ak ghaheawa gooleeysiit ng'asheegeasu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.19.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
